# Run

`Input`s principal function:

~~~
r←{x} Run defMat
~~~

`x` 

: Can an be either a namespace with →[*.Design_principles.Parameter_spaces|global parameters] or a namespace 
with `Input` specific parameters (see `→[##.CreateParms|CreateParms]` for details)
or a vector of length two with both.

`r`

: Is either `⍬` (in case the user did press "Cancel") or a matrix with →[##.The_result|results].
